       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.    SWI50900.
      ******************************************************************
      *     PROGRAMA SWI50900.                                    *
      *                                                                *
      *     Lista de mensagens
      ******************************************************************
      *     LOG ALTERACOES:                                            *
      *   USER     / DATA     /   REFERENCIA / OBSERVACOES             *
      *                                                                *
      *                                                                *
      ******************************************************************
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       DATA DIVISION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                          PIC X(40) VALUE
           'INICIO WORKING-STORAGE SWI50900         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            DECLARACOES DE DB2
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SWCD8101 END-EXEC.
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE SQLCA    END-EXEC.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            MENSAGEM DE INPUT E  OUTPUT
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY SWCV5090.
       COPY SWCV5091.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       COPY VIAL0015.
       COPY VIAW0005.
       COPY VIAK0001.
       COPY VIAK0002.
       COPY SWCK0001.
       COPY SWCK0002.
      *
       COPY ARCL0039.
       COPY ETCL0002.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            AREAS DE TRABALHO
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-VARIAVEIS.
           05 WS-GMSG                      PIC  X(1000)    VALUE SPACES.
           05 WS-LEN                       PIC S9(04) COMP VALUE ZEROES.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            SWITCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  SW-SWITCH.
           05 SW-CURSOR                  PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
              88 SW-CURSOR-NONE                    VALUE '0'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-1                       VALUE '1'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-2                       VALUE '2'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-3                       VALUE '3'.
              88 SW-CURSOR-4                       VALUE '3'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            CONSTANTES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-CONSTANTES.
           05 CON-SWVT8101 PIC X(08) VALUE 'SWVT8101'.

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            PROGRAM CONTROL
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  WS-PROGRAM-CONTROL.
           05 WS-PROGNAME     PIC  X(08) VALUE 'SWI50900'.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *              DECLARACOES DE CURSORES DB2                     *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       01  WS-CURSOR-VARS.
           05 FILLER                     PIC X(01) VALUE SPACES.
           EXEC SQL
                DECLARE CURSWT01 CURSOR FOR
                 SELECT
                       CCODMSG
                     , ZMSGORD
                     , GMSG
                     , ILIDO
                     , CPERFIL
                     , CUSERID
                     , HTIMEST
                 FROM SWVT8101
                 WHERE CCODMSG =  :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                   AND ZMSGORD <= :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
                 ORDER BY
                       CCODMSG DESC
                     , ZMSGORD DESC
           END-EXEC

      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       01  FILLER                        PIC X(40) VALUE
           'FIM DA WORKING-STORAGE SWI50900         '.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       LINKAGE SECTION.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *
       COPY VIAL0004.
      *
            EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0009 END-EXEC.
      *
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            0000-MAINLINE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       0000-MAINLINE.
      *
           PERFORM 1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
              THRU 1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
              THRU 2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.

           PERFORM 3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
              THRU 3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
      *
       0099-MAINLINE-EXIT.
           COPY VIAP0004.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '1000-INICIO-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-INPUT    TO SWCV5090-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5090-ASE               TO SWCV5091-ASE.
      *
           MOVE SWCV5090-CCHAVE   TO SWCV5091-CCHAVE
           MOVE SWCV5090-ZMSGORD  TO SWCV5091-ZMSGORD



           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV5091-INDICE.
           PERFORM 1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
              THRU 1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL SWCV5091-PAGINA-CHEIA.
      *
       1099-INICIO-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            1100-LIMPA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       1100-LIMPA-OCCURS.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV5091-INDICE.
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV5091-D-CHAVE(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           MOVE ZEROES
             TO SWCV5091-D-ZMSGORD(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV5091-D-GMSG(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV5091-D-ILIDO(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV5091-D-CPERFIL(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV5091-D-CUSERID(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           MOVE SPACES
             TO SWCV5091-D-HTIMEST(SWCV5091-INDICE)
      *
           .
       1199-LIMPA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2000-PROC-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2000-PROC-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2000-PROC-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           MOVE SWCV5090-NOMEFXLS
             TO SWCV5091-NOMEFXLS
           MOVE SWCV5090-NMAXLIST
             TO SWCV5091-NMAXLIST
      *
           PERFORM 2010-VALIDACOES
              THRU 2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2020-OPEN
                 THRU 2029-OPEN-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              PERFORM 2030-FETCH
                 THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT

              IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
                 IF DB2-OK
                    PERFORM 2040-CONTINUA
                       THRU 2049-CONTINUA-EXIT
                 ELSE
                    COMPUTE SWCV5091-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV5091-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV5091-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV5091-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV5091-LENGTH
                         - SWCV5091-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    MOVE VIAK0002-ERROS-FUNCAO
                                           TO VIAL0002-IND-ERROS
                    MOVE SWCK0002-STATUS-ACTIVO
                                            TO SWCV5091-CCHAVE-S
                    MOVE SWCK0001-CREFEXT-S-DADOS
                                            TO SWCV5091-CCHAVE-MSG
                 END-IF
              END-IF
              PERFORM 2070-CLOSE
                 THRU 2079-CLOSE-EXIT
           END-IF.


       2099-PROC-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.


      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   2010-VALIDACOES
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2010-VALIDACOES.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2010-VALIDACOES' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.


           CONTINUE.

       2019-VALIDACOES-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2020-OPEN
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2020-OPEN.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2020-OPEN' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5090-CCHAVE
             TO SWCD8101-CCODMSG
           MOVE SWCV5090-ZMSGORDP
             TO SWCD8101-ZMSGORD

           IF SWCD8101-ZMSGORD EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE 999999999               TO SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
           END-IF.

      * TO DO - FORMATAR CHAVE PAGINACAO CURSOR - CHAVE: ZMSGORD

           SET SW-CURSOR-NONE TO TRUE


           IF SW-CURSOR-NONE
              SET SW-CURSOR-1 TO TRUE
           END-IF

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        OPEN CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8101               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2029-OPEN-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2030-FETCH
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2030-FETCH.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2030-FETCH' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                       FETCH CURSWT01
                       INTO
                           :SWCD8101-CCODMSG
                         , :SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
                         , :SWCD8101-GMSG
                         , :SWCD8101-ILIDO
                         , :SWCD8101-CPERFIL
                         , :SWCD8101-CUSERID
                         , :SWCD8101-HTIMEST
                    END-EXEC


           END-EVALUATE.

           MOVE CON-SWVT8101               TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME.

           PERFORM 9020-DB2CHECK
              THRU 9029-DB2CHECK-EXIT.

       2039-FETCH-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                       2040-CONTINUA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2040-CONTINUA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2040-CONTINUA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           MOVE ZEROES                     TO SWCV5091-INDICE.
           PERFORM 2050-TRATA-OCCURS
              THRU 2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT
             UNTIL DB2-NOTFND
                OR SWCV5091-PAGINA-CHEIA
                OR NOT VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS.

           IF VIAL0002-SEM-ERROS
              IF NOT SWCV5091-PAGINA-CHEIA
                    COMPUTE SWCV5091-INDICE-INVERSO EQUAL
                         SWCV5091-INDICE-INVERSO - SWCV5091-INDICE
                    COMPUTE SWCV5091-DIMINUI-LENGTH EQUAL
                         SWCV5091-INDICE-INVERSO * SWCV5091-LENGTH-OCCUR
                    COMPUTE SWCV5091-LENGTH EQUAL SWCV5091-LENGTH -
                         SWCV5091-DIMINUI-LENGTH
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
              IF DB2-NOTFND
                    SET  VIAL0002-FIM-CONSULTA TO TRUE
              END-IF
           END-IF.

       2049-CONTINUA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            2050-TRATA-OCCURS
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2050-TRATA-OCCURS.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2050-TRATA-OCCURS' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.
      *
           ADD 1                       TO SWCV5091-INDICE.
           MOVE SWCD8101-CCODMSG
             TO SWCV5091-D-CHAVE(SWCV5091-INDICE).
           MOVE SWCD8101-ZMSGORD
             TO SWCV5091-D-ZMSGORD(SWCV5091-INDICE).
           MOVE FUNCTION TRIM( SWCD8101-GMSG )
                                       TO WS-GMSG.
           MOVE ZEROES                 TO WS-LEN.
           INSPECT FUNCTION REVERSE( WS-GMSG )
              TALLYING WS-LEN FOR LEADING SPACES.
           COMPUTE WS-LEN = LENGTH OF WS-GMSG - WS-LEN.
           IF WS-LEN > 50
              STRING
                 SWCD8101-GMSG( 1 : 45 )
                 '[...]' DELIMITED BY SIZE
                    INTO SWCV5091-D-GMSG(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCD8101-GMSG
                TO SWCV5091-D-GMSG(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           END-IF.
           MOVE SWCD8101-ILIDO
             TO SWCV5091-D-ILIDO(SWCV5091-INDICE).
           IF SWCD8101-ILIDO EQUAL 'S'
              MOVE SWCD8101-CPERFIL
                TO SWCV5091-D-CPERFIL(SWCV5091-INDICE)
              MOVE SWCD8101-CUSERID
                TO SWCV5091-D-CUSERID(SWCV5091-INDICE)
              MOVE SWCD8101-HTIMEST
                TO SWCV5091-D-HTIMEST(SWCV5091-INDICE)
           END-IF.
      *
           PERFORM 2030-FETCH
              THRU 2039-FETCH-EXIT.
      *
       2059-TRATA-OCCURS-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *                     2070-CLOSE
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       2070-CLOSE.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '2070-CLOSE' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           EVALUATE TRUE
               WHEN SW-CURSOR-1
                    EXEC SQL
                        CLOSE CURSWT01
                    END-EXEC
           END-EVALUATE.

       2079-CLOSE-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
      *            3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
       3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA.
      *
           IF VIAL0001-DEBUG-SIM
              MOVE '3000-FINAL-PROGRAMA' TO VIAL0015-CALLER-ID
              PERFORM VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG
                 THRU VIAP0016-TRATA-DEBUG-EXIT
           END-IF.

           IF SWCV5090-NMAXLIST EQUAL ZEROES
              MOVE VIAL0001-CAPLIC         TO ARCL0039-CAPLIC
              MOVE VIAL0001-COPCAO         TO ARCL0039-COPCAO
              PERFORM ARCR0039-NMAXLIST
                 THRU ARCR0039-NMAXLIST-EXIT

              IF ETCL0002-ABEND-DB2
                 MOVE ETCL0002-TABLE-NAME  TO VIAL0002-TABLE-NAME
                 MOVE ETCL0002-SQLCA       TO VIAL0002-SQLCA
              END-IF

              MOVE ARCL0039-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV5091-NMAXLIST
           ELSE
              MOVE SWCV5090-NMAXLIST       TO SWCV5091-NMAXLIST
           END-IF.

           MOVE SWCV5091-MSG               TO VIAL0001-MENSAGEM-OUTPUT.
           MOVE SWCV5091-LENGTH            TO VIAL0001-LENGTH-MSG.
           MOVE SWCV5091-NR-CAMPOS         TO VIAL0001-NR-CAMPOS.
           MOVE SWCV5091-INDICE            TO VIAL0001-OCORRENCIAS.

       3099-FINAL-PROGRAMA-EXIT.
           EXIT.
      *--------------------------------------------------------------
           EXEC SQL INCLUDE VIAP0003 END-EXEC.
      *==============================================================
           COPY VIAP0016.
           COPY ARCR0039.

